# sensor.map — Per-device sensor overrides
# Format: I2C_ADDR:CHIP_ID=DRIVER_NAME
# One entry per line. Empty lines and lines starting with # are ignored.
# This file is read by S10sensor-detect BEFORE the built-in KNOWN_SENSORS list,
# so entries here take precedence.

# Example overrides for this specific camera:
# 0x30:0x10=sc2336p
# 0x32:0x10=sc2336ps1

# Add custom mappings below if this unit has non-standard sensors:
# 0x30:0x22=gc2053
# 0x32:0x46=gc4653